DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
SUMMARY:Maryland Christmas Show
DESCRIPTION:Nothing brings back the yuletide spirit quite like the Maryland Christmas Show. The Maryland Christmas show is a local\, family-owned Christmas arts & crafts show. For the 42nd season\, visitors from near and far will discover the joys of shopping at Maryland's premier Christmas event. The Maryland Christmas Show\, located in historic Frederick City\, brings together many fine artisans and merchants to provide you with a next-level holiday shopping experience. At the show\, immerse yourself in seven heated buildings filled with crafters and artisans selling clothing\, textiles\, glass\, jewelry\, mixed media\, painting and prints\, photography\, pottery and clay\, printmaking\, wood\, apothecary\, and specialty food and beverages. Join us for one or both weekends of our two-weekend event. We will kick off the show November 20-22 and close the event November 27-29\, 2026. It is important to note that not all exhibitors participate in both weekends. The Maryland Christmas Show brings joy to all ages– satisfying the whole family's Christmas needs. Gather your loved ones and join us in celebrating the holiday season! Purchase tickets online early or at the gate the day of the show.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/maryland-christmas-show/9126/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgevent2026exhibitsatmuseumoffrederickcountyhistory24908-20261121@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261115T165621Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:2026 Exhibits at Museum of Frederick County History
DESCRIPTION:Take a deep dive into various topics that have defined Frederick's history\, as we celebrate America's 250th anniversary and our County's role in the Revolution. Featuring brand new exhibits: Cultivating Independence: Frederick in the Revolution Witnessing Revolution All Saints Street: Avenue to the History of Frederick and Its African American Community Growing Gold: A History of Frederick’s Goldfish Industry And returning favorites: Etchison Connections Timeless Toys 24 E Church Street Decorative Arts See our all new and renovated exhibits\, March 7\,2026 through December 12\, 2026. Buy tickets here.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/2026-exhibits-at-museum-of-frederick-county-history/24908/
END:VEVENT
